-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
THIRD-PARTY & UPSTREAM ATTRIBUTION NOTICE
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This repository contains an independent, clean-room browser & Python digital
twin simulator (`src/`, `web/`, `tests/`, `scripts/`). It does NOT bundle or
redistribute upstream source code, third-party STL/CAD files, or pre-trained
ONNX/audio assets in the Git tree.

When you run `bash scripts/fetch_upstream_assets.sh`, assets are fetched
directly from the official upstream repositories on your local machine under
their respective terms:

1. Pollen Robotics — MicroDuck Software Stack (`pollen-robotics/microduck`)
   - URL: https://github.com/pollen-robotics/microduck
   - License: Apache License 2.0

2. Pollen Robotics — MicroDuck Reinforcement Learning (`pollen-robotics/microduck_rl`)
   - URL: https://github.com/pollen-robotics/microduck_rl
   - Policies: https://huggingface.co/pollen-robotics/microduck-policies
   - License: Apache License 2.0

3. Luwu Intelligence Technology (XGO) — XGO-Duck Hardware (`LuwuDynamics/xgoduck_hardware`)
   - URL: https://github.com/LuwuDynamics/xgoduck_hardware
   - Terms: Personal and educational replication permitted; separate
     authorization required from the hardware maintainer for commercial use
     (see upstream `LICENSING.md`).
